      "translation": "返回配置的<a href=\"ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator.OverflowStrategy.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator.OverflowStrategy</code></a>。",
