    {
      "source": "<code>bufferSizeLimit</code> - the buffer-size limit (number of bytes)",
      "translation": "<code>bufferSizeLimit</code> - 缓冲区大小限制（字节数）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> The underlying standard WebSocket session (JSR-356) does\nnot allow concurrent sending. Therefore, sending must be synchronized. To ensure\nthat, one option is to wrap the <code>WebSocketSession</code> with the\n<a href=\"ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 底层标准 WebSocket 会话（JSR-356）不允许并发发送。因此，必须对发送操作进行同步。为确保这一点，一种选择是将 <code>WebSocketSession</code> 包装在<a href=\"ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator</code></a>中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If a <code>send</code> is slow, subsequent attempts to send more messages from\nother threads will not be able to acquire the flush lock, and messages will be\nbuffered instead. At that time, the specified buffer-size limit and send-time\nlimit will be checked, and the session will be closed if the limits are exceeded.",
      "translation": "如果 `<code>send</code>` 操作缓慢，其他线程尝试发送更多消息时将无法获取刷新锁，消息将被缓冲。此时将检查指定的缓冲区大小限制和发送时间限制，若超过限制则关闭会话。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Basic constructor.",
      "translation": "基本构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Constructor that also specifies the overflow strategy to use.",
      "translation": "也指定要使用的溢出策略的构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Close the WebSocket connection with the given close status.",
      "translation": "使用给定的关闭状态关闭 WebSocket 连接。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the current buffer size (number of bytes).",
      "translation": "返回当前缓冲区大小（字节数）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the configured buffer-size limit (number of bytes).",
      "translation": "返回配置的缓冲区大小限制（字节数）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the configured send-time limit (milliseconds).",
